> \[
> -H_{\cap}^2=\sum_ph_p^2\ge B^2-1.                       \tag{2.6}
> \]
> Equivalently, the total splitting and normalized-divergence defect is at
> most one. The inequality is allowed to use polynomial origin, the divisor
