+## 2. The normalized bi-Rees algebra and its balanced rooftop
+
+### 2.1 The algebra
+
+Consider the normalized bi-Rees algebra
+
+\[
+\mathscr R^\nu(\mathfrak a,\mathfrak b)
+:=\overline{\mathcal O_{\mathbf P^2}
+ [\mathfrak a u,\mathfrak b v]}.                      \tag{2.1}
+\]
