+For ideals, `v(I+J)=min(v(I),v(J))`, and values multiply under powers.
+Therefore
+
+\[
+\begin{aligned}
+v(\mathfrak a^\beta+\mathfrak b^\alpha)
+ &=\min\bigl(\beta v(\mathfrak a),\alpha v(\mathfrak b)\bigr)\\
+ &=\min\bigl(\beta v(F),\alpha v(G),Nv(Z)\bigr)\\
